    "在远程服务器上执行 shell 命令并返回 exitCode / stdout / stderr。两种方式二选一：传 session（持久会话，状态保留）或传 server（一次性执行，独立连接，cwd 仅此模式可用）。命令应是完整的多行脚本（heredoc 等吞行的写法需自行收尾）。默认超时 30 秒（timeoutSeconds 可调 5-600）：一次性执行超时仅返回部分输出；持久会话超时会被关闭，需重新 ssh_open_session。远端登录 shell 需为 POSIX 系（bash/sh/zsh/ksh 等）。单流输出超 512KB 截断。任何凭据都不会提供，输出中的 [REDACTED] 为脱敏占位符。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run a shell command on a remote server and get exitCode / stdout / stderr back. Choose one of two modes: pass session (persistent session, state kept) or server (one-shot execution, dedicated connection, cwd only available in this mode). The command should be a complete multi-line script (terminate line-swallowing constructs such as heredocs yourself). Default timeout 30 seconds (timeoutSeconds adjustable 5-600): a one-shot timeout returns partial output; a persistent-session timeout closes the session, requiring ssh_open_session again. The remote login shell must be POSIX-family (bash/sh/zsh/ksh, etc.). A single output stream over 512KB is truncated. No credentials are ever provided; [REDACTED] in the output is a redaction placeholder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在远程服务器上执行 shell 命令并返回 exitCode / stdout / stderr。两种方式二选一：传 session（持久会话，状态保留）或传 server（一次性执行，独立连接，cwd 仅此模式可用）。命令应是完整的多行脚本（heredoc 等吞行的写法需自行收尾）。默认超时 30 秒（timeoutSeconds 可调 5-600）：一次性执行超时仅返回部分输出；持久会话超时会被关闭，需重新 ssh_open_session。远端登录 shell 需为 POSIX 系（bash/sh/zsh/ksh 等）。单流输出超 512KB 截断。任何凭据都不会提供，输出中的 [REDACTED] 为脱敏占位符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
