    "打开到指定服务器的持久 SSH 会话。会话保持真实 shell 状态：cd、环境变量、venv 激活等跨命令保留。cwd 可选（会话起始目录，不存在会报错）。会话空闲 30 分钟或存活满 2 小时会被自动回收；并发上限 8 个。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open a persistent SSH session to the given server. The session keeps a real shell state: cd, environment variables, venv activation, etc. persist across commands. cwd is optional (starting directory; an error is raised if it does not exist). Sessions are recycled automatically after 30 minutes idle or 2 hours alive; at most 8 concurrent sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开到指定服务器的持久 SSH 会话。会话保持真实 shell 状态：cd、环境变量、venv 激活等跨命令保留。cwd 可选（会话起始目录，不存在会报错）。会话空闲 30 分钟或存活满 2 小时会被自动回收；并发上限 8 个。"
          }
        }
      }
